usage: flow-analyze [-h] [--standard {misra-c-2024,cert-c}]
                    [--fail-on-violation]
                    input

Scan generated C for MISRA/CERT patterns

positional arguments:
  input                 Generated .c file (or - for stdin)

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --standard {misra-c-2024,cert-c}
                        Compliance standard label for the report
  --fail-on-violation   Exit 1 when any VIOLATION is reported
